+Example readmes should avoid **parent-relative** links (`../` out of the example) to `components/`, `docs/`, or other examples, because **Simplicity Studio** often copies only one example and those targets disappear. Links to files **inside the same example folder** (or its `resources/` subtree) may use **relative** paths. For anything outside that tree, use absolute GitHub blob URLs and docs.silabs.com URLs aligned with [`utilities/link_management/links.yaml`](utilities/link_management/links.yaml). See [`utilities/link_management/LINK_MANAGEMENT.md`](utilities/link_management/LINK_MANAGEMENT.md) and run `python utilities/link_management/wiseconnect_links.py validate` before submitting a pull request.
